<h2 id="sec-1">快速比較</h2>
<p>掃地機器人市場已爆發式增長 and finding quality models under $300 requires careful evaluation. 我們測試了 20 robot vacuums in real home environments over three months, 測量吸力、導航準確度、電池續航和應用程式功能。</p>
